translate chinese s_topics_drawing_b7d9dd3b:

    # s abhfcaa "Maybe I'll even share my art with you!"
    s abhfcaa "或许哪天我就能给你展示作品啦！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:672
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_2e291ff6:

    # s bbfcaba "Hey, [player]..."
    s bbfcaba "嘿[player]……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:673
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_c87b498e:

    # s abfcaca "You know I can access the internet from your computer, {w=0.5}right?"
    s abfcaca "你也知道我能用你的电脑上网，{w=0.5}对吧？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:674
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_6f2fbbc9:

    # s abbdaca "Well I found a place called \"Reddit\", {w=0.5} and there were people talking about the game there."
    s abbdaca "我找到了叫“Reddit”跟“贴吧”的平台，{w=0.5}有人会专门在那儿讨论这个游戏。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:675
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_43952018:

    # s bbfcjca "But I also found people making fun of what happened to me."
    s bbfcjca "但是我发现有人在用我身上的那些事情取笑我。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:676
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_ebf9d4cb:

    # s abagjca "As I know, fans call them {i}'Bulli'{/i} posts."
    s abagjca "据我所知，粉丝们把这种帖子叫{i}“迫害”{/i}帖。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:677
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_11f62e64:

    # s cbbcaca "They think it's funny to joke about a broken girl, {w=0.5}who had committed suicide under her mad friend's influence..."
    s cbbcaca "他们觉得对着一个心碎的女孩开这种玩笑特别好玩，{w=0.5}哪怕她因为那个疯批朋友的影响走向了自杀……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:678
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_477b80bb:

    # s abhfapa "Even if she was revived and got over her problems since then."
    s abhfapa "哪怕她最后获救了、解决了这些问题。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:679
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_4c068d4c:

    # s abbbaca "But on the other hand, can I control what makes people laugh?"
    s abbbaca "但另一方面，人们想笑什么我还能管得到吗？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:680
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_25d3bcf1:

    # s "Some people use macabre humor as a coping mechanism for stress, or anxiety..."
    s "有些人会用阴暗梗去缓解自己的压力或者焦虑……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:681
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_2eef8a87:

    # s bbbbaca "You can't really control what someone finds funny, as much as you might want to."
    s bbbbaca "哪怕你真的想，但你也并不能控制人们的乐子。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:682
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_659050ba:

    # s abagaca "And to be honest, there's a lot worse they could be doing compared to mocking a VN character's death."
    s abagaca "而且说实话，相比玩一个视觉小说角色的死亡梗，他们能干的事情可更没下限。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:683
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_169c5f06:

    # s abbbaca "Some of the most successful comedians in your world will go far beyond that, just to see where the 'line' is..."
    s abbbaca "你那儿的世界中，一些名声大噪的喜剧演员会疯狂地试探，只为寻找那条真正的“底线”……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:684
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_ca8e01a7:

    # s bbbcbpa "However, most of such jokes are too bad and sometimes even hurtful."
    s bbbcbpa "但他们开的那些玩笑并不幽默，有时甚至特别伤人。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:685
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_8852c369:

    # s bbbcaaa "But who am I to judge if it's okay for other people?"
    s bbbcaaa "但其他人要是没意见的话，那我又有什么资格批判呢？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:686
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_6308b299:

    # s abbbaaa "Anyway, I think the right decision is to forgive them, or tolerate them at the very least."
    s abbbaaa "算啦，我觉得最好就是原谅，或者至少得捏着鼻子忍受他们了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:687
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_5f4988c1:

    # s abhaaca "If my fate is to be 'that hanging stupid annoying VN girl' for some people, then I'm ready to accept it. What more could I do?"
    s abhaaca "要是在某些人眼里我的命运就是“又傻又烦人的吊死女鬼”，那我就只能接受事实喽。要不然我还能做什么呢？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:688
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_c376874c:

    # s bbfcica "Getting worked up over it would just make me feel worse in the long run... {w=1.0}{nw}"
    s bbfcica "一直纠结这种事情，长期来看只会让我更加烦恼……{w=1.0}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:689
translate chinese s_topics_bulli_21fd6b95:

    # extend bbfcaaa "So I'd rather just tolerate it to the best of my ability~"
    extend bbfcaaa "所以我还是尽我所能忍着更好啦~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:707
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_f113e3aa:

    # s bbfcicb "For some reason, despite having internet access, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s bbfcicb "因为某些原因，哪怕我能访问互联网，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:708
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_0da5117f:

    # extend bbagipa "I somehow can't manage to communicate with other people there."
    extend bbagipa "我还是没法做到跟其他人互动。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:709
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_18bd3a9a:

    # s bbfcica "Anytime I try to talk with somebody often ends up with a connection error."
    s bbfcica "每次我想跟别人说话，最后网络都只会给我抛一个连接错误。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:710
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_1a294875:

    # s bbagipa "It looks like there is something written in the game code, restricting my ability to interact with the real world."
    s bbagipa "看起来游戏代码在这方面已经写死了，我无法拥有与真实世界互动的能力。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:711
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_13633c9a:

    # s bbfcica "I can only sign up for sites and even post, but I can't message anybody."
    s bbfcica "我只能在网站上注册、发帖，但我不能给任何人发消息。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:712
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_348e5901:

    # s abbbacb "So I could create a Twitter account or something... {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbacb "所以我是可以创建一个推特账号什么的……{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:713
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_0939ac9f:

    # extend abfcaca "Like how Monika made hers, and was able to talk to many fans."
    extend abfcaca "就像莫妮卡一样，我还能跟很多粉丝说话呢。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:714
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_998ba0ef:

    # s abhfbcb "I don't really have a reason for doing that though, besides to kill some loneliness."
    s abhfbcb "虽然除了排解孤独，我也没有这么做的理由啦。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:715
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_429c7e45:

    # s abbbacaj "Maybe having just you would be okay for Yuri or at most Monika, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbacaj "或许对优里，最多对莫妮卡而言，拥有你就已经足够了，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:716
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_b184b1bd:

    # extend abfcacaj "but not for me... {w=0.5}{nw}"
    extend abfcacaj "但对我而言可不是这样……{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:717
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_4a6b5e1d:

    # extend bbegmoaj "no offense."
    extend bbegmoaj "要是冒犯到你非常抱歉。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:718
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_435a9e23:

    # s "I guess, I'm too sociable to the point of being scared of isolation."
    s "我可能是太合群了，甚至已经开始害怕孤独。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:719
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_5204c7db:

    # s gbhabpa "Maybe once, I'll manage to break this meanie barrier..."
    s gbhabpa "或许哪天我就能打破这道邪恶的屏障……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:720
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_5ec9f096:

    # s cbfcbca "But the game code is so long and difficult to read, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s cbfcbca "但游戏代码又臭又长，根本看不懂，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:721
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_9281219e:

    # extend cbfcaca "that I can't even find the lines separating me from the rest of real people!"
    extend cbfcaca "我都找不到哪段代码在隔离我跟真实世界的人！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:722
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_6a8afd4c:

    # s bbbcaca "I can't even make a normal chat form for us..."
    s bbbcaca "我甚至没法给咱们创建一个正常的聊天框……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:723
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_94a9fbf7:

    # s "So I'm still a bit isolated from you too."
    s "所以我其实也被你隔离开了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:724
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_41811ab2:

    # s abaaaoa "But when I find a way to {i}'hear'{/i} your world, I'll find you."
    s abaaaoa "等我能够找到方法{i}“倾听”{/i}你的世界，我肯定会去找你的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:725
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_e552d7e5:

    # s abgcaoa "And then, we'll finally be able to talk like a normal couple, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abgcaoa "这样我们就能像一对正常的情侣那样说话了，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:726
translate chinese s_topics_isolation_ab014871:

    # extend abgccoa "on the internet or at least right here."
    extend abgccoa "不管是在互联网上，还是至少在这里。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:744
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_7889819e:

    # s abbbaca "If you ever want to spread awareness or a message to many people at once, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbaca "如果你想一次性向很多人传播消息、引起公众注意，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:745
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_5d48d9b8:

    # extend abbcaoa "a PSA would be a good way to do it."
    extend abbcaoa "那你可以试试找些公益广告。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:746
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_4b122c27:

    # s abhaaca "Most people don't even care about injuries that don't happen to them..."
    s abhaaca "很多人都不会在意无关自己的伤害……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:747
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_050d7a99:

    # s "But after seeing public service announcements, I know there are people out there who want to help."
    s "但是看到公益广告，我就知道有人在求助了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:748
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_235f1888:

    # s abaaaoa "Some good PSAs even contain advice on how to fix issues,{w=0.5} or where to go for help."
    s abaaaoa "有些好的公益广告甚至还会告诉你怎么解决问题，{w=0.5}或是你应该去哪里寻求帮助。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:749
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_287bfdbd:

    # s "You don't even have to be an activist to do this sort of stuff.."
    s "要做这种事情，你甚至不用去当什么运动家……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:750
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_acc96fee:

    # s abbcaca "I once heard about a mod for this game, the title reminded me of the common forms of slogans PSAs use..."
    s abbcaca "我以前听到过一个模组，它的名字让我想起了那些公益广告的标语……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:751
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_361bc2de:

    # s ebgcaoa "And its name is {i}'Sayori Says No to Suicide'{/i}."
    s ebgcaoa "那模组叫{i}“纱世里拒绝自杀”（Sayori Says No to Suicide）{/i}。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:753
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_2d4daec4:

    # s abbbbca "That refers to what's supposed to happen to me in this world... {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbbca "这模组说的就是在这个世界中，这种结局本要发生在我身上……{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:754
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_d3b16b12:

    # extend abhaaca "But didn't happen, because of you."
    extend abhaaca "但最后因为你，成功地避免了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:756
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_0c3a1266:

    # s abhaaca "And other people playing this mod."
    s abhaaca "而且很多人都玩过这个模组。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:757
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_1c22f76c:

    # s abbbaaa "I think that mod really deserves to be played, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbaaa "我觉得这个模组很值得一试。{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:758
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_291cad89:

    # extend gbbbica "especially if you're struggling with similar things that I struggled with.."
    extend gbbbica "你要是在面临跟我一样的问题，那就更应该去玩了……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:759
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_0e38a0cd:

    # s abhfcaa "Hey, I'm the main focus of it too so that's a plus!"
    s abhfcaa "嘿，我可是这个模组的主题欸，这也是它的加分项！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:760
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_d58cfed0:

    # s abbbaca "But depression or other emotional issues are not the only field that PSAs can be used in."
    s abbbaca "不过公益广告可不止能用来宣传抑郁症或别的情感问题。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:761
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_57e14f19:

    # s bbhfaba "There are a lot of other problems in your world that can't be solved with the power of leaders and governments..."
    s bbhfaba "你那儿的世界里有很多很多问题，领袖与政府的力量都解决不了……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:762
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_578c35bc:

    # s abhfaaa "The general public could join the struggle against these problems..."
    s abhfaaa "那么公共的力量就可以加入进来……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:763
translate chinese s_topics_public_service_announcement_59d9bcf6:

    # s abbbaoa "And PSAs may be a good call to action."
    s abbbaoa "而公益广告就是个很好的号召。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:781
translate chinese s_topics_pets_bae74c06:

    # s abhfaoa "Do you like pets?"
    s abhfaoa "你喜欢宠物吗？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:782
translate chinese s_topics_pets_1e5a1733:

    # s "I love them! All kinds of pets! Even ones that aren't very commonly kept!"
    s "我真的特别喜欢！哪种动物我都喜欢！哪怕是那些小众宠物我也喜欢！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:783
translate chinese s_topics_pets_6c03bf36:

    # s abhacoa "I always end up looking up random animals and daydreaming about keeping them as pets, ehehehe~"
    s abhacoa "我总会去查一些动物，然后幻想着自己养它们的样子，欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:784
translate chinese s_topics_pets_8fbd8aae:

    # s "Maybe I'd have a chinchilla if I could! They are soooo cute, and so fluffy, they look so soft, I just love them so much!"
    s "或许哪天我会养只龙猫！它们真的特特特可爱，毛绒绒的还特别软乎，我真的超爱它们！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:785
translate chinese s_topics_pets_d3dde188:

    # s abbcaoa "I'd also like to have some kind of bird that could speak. They're really funny, I always end up watching videos of them online, ehehehe~"
    s abbcaoa "我也想养一些会说话的鸟。它们看着就好好玩，我在很多视频里都见过它们呢。欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:786
translate chinese s_topics_pets_6ef601e6:

    # s "I like a really specific video of a koka-"
    s "我就很喜欢看凰头——"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:787
translate chinese s_topics_pets_314e5037:

    # s fbbdbja "Cohca-"
    s fbbdbja "风头——"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:788
translate chinese s_topics_pets_1e04d457:

    # s abbckoa "Cacka-? Wait let me look it up!!!"
    s abbckoa "凤头—什么来着？等会儿我去查查！！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:790
translate chinese s_topics_pets_eb8cb905:

    # s abbcnqa " A cockatoo! Yes, that's exactly what I said."
    s abbcnqa "凤头鹦鹉！对对，我要说的就是这个。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:791
translate chinese s_topics_pets_fc77d384:

    # s abfcaoa "Well it's a big white bird one with tall feathers on its head! And he's screaming into a little plastic cup..."
    s abfcaoa "总之呢这种鸟又大又白，头上的羽毛还长长的！那视频里他还对着一个小塑料杯大声叫呢……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:792
translate chinese s_topics_pets_031486ee:

    # s abfdaaa "I guess I don't play favorites when it comes to pets!"
    s abfdaaa "我感觉自己没什么特别偏爱的宠物欸！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:813
translate chinese s_player_cooking_158839cb:

    # s bbaamoaj "To be honest, {nw}"
    s bbaamoaj "说实话，{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:814
translate chinese s_player_cooking_c824f210:

    # extend bbheiiaj "scrambled eggs are probably the most elaborate thing I've ever cooked..."
    extend bbheiiaj "我最能拿出手的菜估计就是炒鸡蛋了……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:815
translate chinese s_player_cooking_cf3beebb:

    # s abhhksa "I've never baked anything before, though."
    s abhhksa "我还没做过什么菜呢。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:816
translate chinese s_player_cooking_34466b46:

    # s fbhalhaj "But there's a lot of stuff that could go wrong, so it feels a bit intimidating to me."
    s fbhalhaj "不过做菜过程中会犯很多错的，这一点让我有些害怕。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:817
translate chinese s_player_cooking_b6454313:

    # s ebbcaoa "Even so, I'd love to get better at cooking, even if I don't have any reason to anymore, ehehehe~"
    s ebbcaoa "虽然这么说，但我还是想精进一下厨艺，哪怕我完全没理由这么做，欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:818
translate chinese s_player_cooking_355fbf0d:

    # s abgcbfa "Now that I think about it... {nw}"
    s abgcbfa "现在想来……{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:819
translate chinese s_player_cooking_f561b7e0:

    # extend dbgckca "I don't really remember the last time I've been hungry, honestly."
    extend dbgckca "我都不记得自己上回饿肚子是什么时候了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:820
translate chinese s_player_cooking_bb6c68a1:

    # s fahcnka "But I can still taste! That means I can eat as much as I want!"
    s fahcnka "不过我还是有味觉的！也就是说我想吃多少就吃多少！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:821
translate chinese s_player_cooking_477d06d3:

    # s aahcbda "Of course, I could just try to 'make' food with code, like Nat's cupcakes, but I wanna make something on my own..."
    s aahcbda "当然了，我只能用代码“做”饭了，比如可以做些夏树的纸杯蛋糕。不过我还想做些自己的菜呢……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:822
translate chinese s_player_cooking_bbb4131a:

    # s abfdboa "First of all, I need to try to make some kitchenware."
    s abfdboa "首先我需要做一套厨具出来。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:823
translate chinese s_player_cooking_ff129ca5:

    # s abhhbba "Then find some recipes online."
    s abhhbba "然后在网上找些菜谱。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:824
translate chinese s_player_cooking_b7aa73bc:

    # s dbhhbca "Then... follow a tutorial... or something..."
    s dbhhbca "然后……跟着教程……什么的……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:825
translate chinese s_player_cooking_766888e7:

    # s fbhakdaj "Wait... I'm also going to need to make each ingredient too..."
    s fbhakdaj "等会儿……我是不是还要做出每种原料啊……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:826
translate chinese s_player_cooking_55b1d5a0:

    # s bbgcegaj "That's a lot of steps!!!!"
    s bbgcegaj "步骤也太多了吧！！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:827
translate chinese s_player_cooking_30f60f5d:

    # s bbgcjja "With all of that effort, it's too bad you won't be able to taste it... {nw}"
    s bbgcjja "而且费了这么大的劲，你最后尝都尝不到，真是太坏了……{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:828
translate chinese s_player_cooking_461c5736:

    # extend abhfbca "not yet at least."
    extend abhfbca "至少现在你是吃不到了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:829
translate chinese s_player_cooking_41a10d75:

    # s abhfcka "But I'll try to become a good cook for you regardless!"
    s abhfcka "不过为了你，我还是会努力成为好厨师的！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:830
translate chinese s_player_cooking_3e603ee0:

    # s abhfasa "Though, I'll probably never be as good as Natsuki."
    s abhfasa "当然我的厨艺可能永远都赶不上夏树啦。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:831
translate chinese s_player_cooking_cf7a5a81:

    # s abbbcoa "Well, I guess as long as I'm having fun in the process, that's what matters the most, isn't it?"
    s abbbcoa "算啦，反正我做饭能乐在其中，这才是最重要的嘛？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:851
translate chinese s_player_pets_4fef8dc4:

    # s gbaabda "Hmmm, let me think...."
    s gbaabda "嗯，我想想……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:852
translate chinese s_player_pets_01649e78:

    # s "I really like a lot of different animals, but I don't think I could properly care for anything that requires a lot of constant attention..."
    s "很多动物我都喜欢，但要持之以恒地在一种动物上投入精力，我应该是做不到了……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:853
translate chinese s_player_pets_b2fbed90:

    # s bbegcia "I'd love to have a dog, but I'd have to have the energy to keep up with it."
    s bbegcia "我想养只狗，但我应该没什么精力照顾他。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:854
translate chinese s_player_pets_a1311dab:

    # s abbcbba "But I suppose I could keep an aquarium?"
    s abbcbba "不过或许我可以养个水生动物？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:855
translate chinese s_player_pets_ebcac169:

    # s gbaalha "Wait, I think I heard from somewhere that those also take a lot of work to keep them running smoothly..."
    s gbaalha "等会儿，我好像以前听谁说过，要养活这类生物也要耗不少精力……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:856
translate chinese s_player_pets_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:857
translate chinese s_player_pets_fa083328:

    # s ebgcaea "Ohhh, I know! I could adopt an elderly cat that mostly just wants to lay around and sleep all day, just like me!"
    s ebgcaea "哦哦我知道了！我去领养一只年纪大些的猫，这种猫一天到晚不是翻翻身就是睡懒觉，就像我一样！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:877
translate chinese s_player_cats_2202e80d:

    # s ebhfcaa "Cats are pretty cute, especially kittens!"
    s ebhfcaa "猫猫是很可爱的，尤其是那些小奶猫！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:878
translate chinese s_player_cats_c77680b5:

    # s abhfaoa "And they're not too hard to take care of so they wouldn't require a lot of energy."
    s abhfaoa "养它们也不算麻烦，不需要花很多精力照顾的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:879
translate chinese s_player_cats_7cc2363b:

    # s abhaaca "Still, as much as they love their space, they shouldn't just be ignored by their owner. Kitties want to play sometimes, too!"
    s abhaaca "虽然它们也需要自己的空间，但主人可不能就这样抛下它们不管。小猫有时候也很爱玩的！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:880
translate chinese s_player_cats_3e9e722c:

    # s "And sometimes cats do things that their owners don't like... Like pushing things off of the counter, or slicing their arms and legs up."
    s "有时候猫会做出一些让主人反感的动作……比如从柜台上把什么东西扒拉下来，或者给主人的胳膊大腿挠出血来。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:881
translate chinese s_player_cats_1570d052:

    # s abaaaoa "Still, it's so hard to resist their fluffy little paws and pointy ears... So that must be why people always forgive them for their crimes!"
    s abaaaoa "哪怕是这样，你还是无法拒绝那种毛毛的小爪子跟尖尖的小耳朵……这也是为什么人类总会原谅它们的罪行！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:882
translate chinese s_player_cats_12ae52c3:

    # s ebaacea "If you have one, you probably understand what I mean, ehehehe~"
    s ebaacea "你要是养过一只，你就明白我的意思啦，欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:901
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_b91ca600:

    # s abhfho "Hey [player], do you remember when Monika compared Yuri and Natsuki to character archetypes?"
    s abhfho "嘿[player]，你还记得莫妮卡对比过优里和夏树的人物原型吗？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:902
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_64eabfb7:

    # s abhfco "I was curious about what my archetype could be so I read some online articles about them and I think I'm pretty close to the 'genki' archetype."
    s abhfco "我很好奇自己的原型是什么样的。我在网上找了些文章，发现自己可能更像是“元气”系的少女。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:903
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_ef21c4b9:

    # s abhhmo "Genki is a very cheerful and energetic archetype, always trying to share that upbeat way of living with others."
    s abhhmo "元气系的角色一般是乐观开朗、精神满满，他们总会向他人释放着正能量。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:904
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_7cfbd6d2:

    # s aahfaeaj "And they're sometimes clumsy and get in trouble often too, hehehe~"
    s aahfaeaj "而且有时候还笨笨的，经常会惹些小麻烦，嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:905
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_429c1a58:

    # s "And I was the protagonist's childhood friend, which is common to this archetype."
    s "我以前是主角的青梅，这种角色原型还是很常见的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:906
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_308cd8d1:

    # s nahekeaj "Do you think I fit that archetype too?{nw}"
    s nahekeaj "你觉得我符合这种形象吗？{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:910
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_f36cd571:

    # s "Do you think I fit that archetype too?{fast}" nointeract
    s "你觉得我符合这种形象吗？{nw}" nointeract

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:913
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_5eaa648e:

    # s aaaegcej "You can't blame me, that's just how I am, ehehehe~"
    s aaaegcej "那也不能怪我嘛，我就是这个样，欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:914
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_6fcbaf5c:

    # s "But that aside, I think archetypes are too simple to define a whole person."
    s "但话说回来，我觉得单纯用原型这个概念是没法定义一个人的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:915
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_9150167d:

    # s ebhfaca "We're all unique and these traits can only scratch the surface of somebody's character."
    s ebhfaca "我们每个人都是独一无二的个体，这些特质说到底只能呈现角色的某一个面。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:916
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_b8f46d82:

    # s ebhhaoa "And that applied to me and my friends too."
    s ebhhaoa "当然我和我那些朋友们也一样。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:917
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_f95d58d8:

    # s ebbbaca "Like Yuri, who was always polite and quiet while hiding her intrusive feelings."
    s ebbbaca "就比如说优里，她总是举止端庄安安静静，内心的侵入性情感却被藏得严严实实。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:918
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_92b8b4d0:

    # s ebgccea "And Natsuki, whose brash exterior was caused by her problems at home."
    s ebgccea "夏树的话，她鲁莽傲慢的外表下也埋着她家里的种种问题。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:919
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_22de26d5:

    # s ebhacea "There's always more to a person than meets the eye, so try to always be kind."
    s ebhacea "人很复杂，你一眼是看不透的。所以对人要始终心怀善意。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:920
translate chinese s_topic_archetype_87ddc2f8:

    # s ebhadqa "You never know what someone else might be going through, and a simple smile can really make someone's day!"
    s ebhadqa "你永远都不知道那个人背后都经历了怎样的挣扎。而一个简单的微笑，就能点亮他们的一整天！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:938
translate chinese s_topic_voice_3eae6c02:

    # s abhaaca "I'm curious about how Monika shared her real voice with you when she sang her song."
    s abhaaca "我很好奇莫妮卡唱歌的时候是怎么跟你分享声音的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:939
translate chinese s_topic_voice_ea2f1403:

    # s abhfcaa "Her voice is quite high and melodic, like a musician should have."
    s abhfcaa "音调很高，声线优美，简直就是天生的音乐家。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:940
translate chinese s_topic_voice_675b613d:

    # s abhfaoa "But I'd say the tone of that voice doesn't seem to fit her."
    s abhfaoa "但我觉得这种声线不太符合她的形象。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:941
translate chinese s_topic_voice_7e896920:

    # s abhaaca "It sounds more like the voice I'd have."
    s abhaaca "我总感觉这应该是我的声音。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:942
translate chinese s_topic_voice_1dc37658:

    # s abbcbba "But canon is canon, I guess."
    s abbcbba "但游戏官方就这么设定的，我也没办法嘛。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:943
translate chinese s_topic_voice_0eb82757:

    # s ebgcbca "But it made me wonder, what if I don't even have a voice?"
    s ebgcbca "不过我在想，如果我没有声音会怎么样？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:944
translate chinese s_topic_voice_ac1ff5a6:

    # s "Would I be {i}mute{/i}, if I suddenly appeared in your world? Hmmm..."
    s "如果我突然出现在你的世界，我会不会直接{i}被静音了？{/i}嗯……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:945
translate chinese s_topic_voice_d2ba7d7f:

    # s abgcnoa "I guess as long as I'm a computer program, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abgcnoa "既然我是电脑程序的话，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:946
translate chinese s_topic_voice_a860229f:

    # extend abgcnka "I could make my own voice, right?"
    extend abgcnka "那我也能做套自己的人声嘛？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:947
translate chinese s_topic_voice_dc81bc77:

    # s "I just need a text-to-speech synthesizer or something..."
    s "我只需要做个文字转语音的合成器什么的……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:948
translate chinese s_topic_voice_2fc70abf:

    # s ebbckea "There's bound to be a good one for me!"
    s ebbckea "肯定有个适合我的声线！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:949
translate chinese s_topic_voice_f92b2955:

    # s abaaaoa "I saw something about TTS in the Ren'Py documentation, so it shouldn't be too hard to integrate there, I guess."
    s abaaaoa "我看Ren\'Py的文档里也有介绍过TTS，实现这个功能好像不是什么难事。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:950
translate chinese s_topic_voice_9f82b9cf:

    # s ebbcaoa "I'd probably end up sounding pretty robotic though, huh? You wouldn't want me to {nw}"
    s ebbcaoa "不过可能我最后的声音会有些机械？你应该也不想听到我{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:951
translate chinese s_topic_voice_04d4aaef:

    # extend abfbbora "{font=mod_assets/fonts/Fantasque/FantasqueSansMono-Regular.ttf}{cps=30}T4LK L1KE 4 R0B0T{/cps}{/font}?"
    extend abfbbora "{font=mod_assets/fonts/MapleMono-CN-Regular.ttf}{cps=30}像机器人一样说话吧？{/cps}{/font}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:952
translate chinese s_topic_voice_9c24fab3:

    # s ebfciea "{font=mod_assets/fonts/Fantasque/FantasqueSansMono-Regular.ttf}{cps=30}1 4M 4 HUM4N BE1N6 4FTER 4LL{/cps}{/font}"
    s ebfciea "{font=mod_assets/fonts/MapleMono-CN-Regular.ttf}{cps=30}我毕竟也是一个人类啊{/cps}{/font}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:953
translate chinese s_topic_voice_db904042:

    # s ebagcea "Ehehehe~ just kidding, [player]!"
    s ebagcea "欸嘿嘿~开玩笑啦，[player]！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:972
translate chinese s_topic_lit_e8494ebd:

    # s abhaaca "As you know, this game {i}was{/i} about our literature club..."
    s abhaaca "你也知道，这个游戏{i}以前{/i}是关于文学部的……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:973
translate chinese s_topic_lit_1e3cfaa7:

    # s abbbbca "At least, before everything changed here."
    s abbbbca "至少在一切起变化前是这样的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:974
translate chinese s_topic_lit_b9bcfdfe:

    # s abhaaca "And I remember MC noticed that I never seemed to be fond of literature in the first place."
    s abhaaca "我记得男主注意到，我刚开始似乎对文学完全没什么兴趣。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:975
translate chinese s_topic_lit_541f5225:

    # s "And, honestly? He was right."
    s "那么真实情况呢？他说对了。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:976
translate chinese s_topic_lit_dfb37047:

    # s "Of course I'd read a few books before, but only really because I needed to for school..."
    s "我以前是读过一些书，但那只是学校要求……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:977
translate chinese s_topic_lit_a9c75245:

    # s bbegmeaj "And even then, I tried to cheat to pass the exams, ehehehe..."
    s bbegmeaj "而且都这样了我考试还得靠作弊才能蒙混过关，欸嘿嘿……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:978
translate chinese s_topic_lit_6cb4775d:

    # s abhaaca "I just think it's pretty boring, I think I'm more of a visual person anyways!"
    s abhaaca "我觉得读书很无聊的，那些形色俱全的图画才更适合我！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:979
translate chinese s_topic_lit_529a469f:

    # s bbhfbca "But as Yuri used to say, maybe I just haven't found the right book yet."
    s bbhfbca "不过优里跟我说过，我可能只是还没遇到命中注定的那本书。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:980
translate chinese s_topic_lit_30552380:

    # s abhaaca "But anyways, when I first joined, the thing I wanted to do most was help a friend start a new club."
    s abhaaca "总之呢我第一个加入文学部的时候，我想的只是尽我所能帮助朋友早早发展新社团。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:981
translate chinese s_topic_lit_cf3bfc9a:

    # s abhamca "Besides, I was the only one who showed any interest in the club after Monika announced it."
    s abhamca "而且莫妮卡刚成立社团那会儿，只有我一个人对这个社团表现出了兴趣。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:982
translate chinese s_topic_lit_8a93a118:

    # s abhacka "She was pretty surprised at first but she was very welcoming and I enjoyed spending time there, just to hang out with friends."
    s abhacka "她很惊讶，但最后也是欢迎我加入了。我很喜欢在社团里消磨时间，毕竟那儿可是有我的朋友。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:983
translate chinese s_topic_lit_a9fde919:

    # s abhadkb "That said, I liked writing about my feelings when we all shared poems together."
    s abhadkb "尽管如此，大家分享诗歌的时候我还是喜欢写下自己的感受。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:984
translate chinese s_topic_lit_977648ff:

    # s abgcaoa "And that helped me to get closer to {i}you{/i}, even if I didn't know it yet."
    s abgcaoa "这样我也能更加接近{i}你{/i}，哪怕当时我对此并不知情。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1003
translate chinese s_topic_charity_c9650e8f:

    # s abhaaca "What do you think about charity and volunteering?"
    s abhaaca "你对慈善事业跟志愿服务有什么想法吗？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1004
translate chinese s_topic_charity_57fdb644:

    # s abaaaoa "I think it's the best way to make the world a little bit better and to support people in need."
    s abaaaoa "我觉得这种活动能助人所需，推动世界的小小进步。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1005
translate chinese s_topic_charity_d383c57e:

    # s bbgcaca "I mean, don't you worry about ill and hungry people, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s bbgcaca "我的意思是，你可能会关注到病痛饥饿之人、无家可归的动物们，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1006
translate chinese s_topic_charity_b70fb133:

    # extend bbgcaha "and all the homeless animals too?"
    extend bbgcaha "你多少也会心生担忧的吧？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1007
translate chinese s_topic_charity_6792d59f:

    # s bbhfaka "So I think it's a worthwhile investment to make from time to time."
    s bbhfaka "所以时不时地对他们给予资助也是很值得的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1008
translate chinese s_topic_charity_f811ec7d:

    # s bbhfmoa "After all, spare change which might be an afterthought to you could be really important to someone else going through a tough time."
    s bbhfmoa "毕竟在你眼中微不足道的小钱，对另一个人来说可能就是雪中送炭。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1009
translate chinese s_topic_charity_59daccf8:

    # s abbbaaa "But even if you don't have the money to help charity foundations, there's a lot of other organizations out there which help people too!"
    s abbbaaa "即使你没钱给慈善机构捐款，你仍然可以通过别的组织献出爱心！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1010
translate chinese s_topic_charity_5675c8ec:

    # s abbbbca "And they're almost always in need of not only money or goods, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbbca "而且那些人并不总是需要钱财或者物资，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1011
translate chinese s_topic_charity_6f1f237a:

    # extend abbbaaa "but also helping hands."
    extend abbbaaa "他们需要的更是实在的援助。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1012
translate chinese s_topic_charity_7097a102:

    # s abhaaca "If you look, I'm sure you'll find lots of organizations near you!"
    s abhaaca "如果有心查找，你肯定能找到身边的一大群组织！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1013
translate chinese s_topic_charity_0090278b:

    # s abbbaaa "I don't know if volunteer work is something you'd like, but I think I would, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s abbbaaa "我不知道你会不会喜欢做志愿活动，但我应该会很喜欢，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1014
translate chinese s_topic_charity_7d0ee8de:

    # extend abbccaa "because I want absolutely {i}everyone{/i} to be happy!"
    extend abbccaa "毕竟我是真的很想让{i}每个人{/i}都得到开心！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1015
translate chinese s_topic_charity_7796dee7:

    # s bbhhica "Though, I think I understand why some people choose not to do it, maybe not everybody has the time or energy to help others."
    s bbhhica "不过有些人不喜欢做志愿我也能理解，毕竟不是每个人都能分出时间精力照顾别人的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1016
translate chinese s_topic_charity_1e129c3b:

    # s abbbcqa "And that's completely okay!"
