translate chinese s_answer_god_099eab0a:

    # s abbbaca "I was never really sure what to think about religion; I guess you could say I was agnostic?"
    s abbbaca "我不知道要对宗教抱有什么样的看法；可以说我是个不可知论者？"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1982
translate chinese s_answer_god_e96c5e12:

    # s abhabaca "But it's kind of hard to stay that way when you realize that you and your entire world have a 'creator'."
    s abhabaca "但这种思维也站不住脚，尤其是你意识到自己和所在的这个世界，是真的有一个“造物主”的。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1983
translate chinese s_answer_god_52cf6982:

    # s abbccoa "Blessed be {i}Dan Salvato{/i}, hallowed be thy name! Ehehehe~"
    s abbccoa "赞我们在现实的{i}Dan Salvato{/i}，愿人都尊你的名为圣！欸嘿嘿~"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1984
translate chinese s_answer_god_26ad5102:

    # s abbcaca "He's a pretty cool guy, but he’s pretty secretive about whatever he's working on from what I’ve seen online."
    s abbcaca "他人真的很好，但从我在网上搜的资料来看，他对自己着手的项目可是隐瞒了不少。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:1985
translate chinese s_answer_god_0c8a761d:

    # s abhabaca "He's more like a Dad rather than some unapproachable God, I think."
    s abhabaca "我觉得他更像是我的“父亲”，而不是远在天边不可触碰的神。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2004
translate chinese s_answer_politics_e2c66328:

    # s bbegmoaj "I'm not overly politically inclined, to tell you the truth."
    s bbegmoaj "说实话我没什么政治倾向。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2005
translate chinese s_answer_politics_387c183f:

    # s abhabaca "I don't really care how exactly people make collective decisions, give orders and share boons."
    s abhabaca "集体决策、下达指令、分配利益这些事情，我其实不怎么关心。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2006
translate chinese s_answer_politics_a29affe9:

    # s abbbaaa "For me, the most important thing is that people just live their lives without interrupting anyone else's happiness."
    s abbbaaa "对我来说，最重要的就是人们能过着自己的生活，同时也不去侵犯他人的幸福。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2007
translate chinese s_answer_politics_2d5aca3f:

    # s abbcaca "And that people can live without worrying about basic necessities, like food or shelter."
    s abbcaca "而且也不用为了衣食住行等等基本需求，成天过着提心吊胆的日子。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2008
translate chinese s_answer_politics_4d643331:

    # s "The beauty of it all is that I'm a free person that can have my own opinion on society."
    s "好的一点在于我是一个自由人，我对社会可以有自己的看法。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2009
translate chinese s_answer_politics_db591b8b:

    # s abhaaca "Too often, people don't lift a finger to stop injustice until it directly affects them..."
    s abhaaca "人们往往对无关的不公袖手旁观，直到这种不公波及到他们……"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2010
translate chinese s_answer_politics_5d0d0a4c:

    # s abbbaca "If you've never seen them, you should read some of {i}Martin Niemöller’s{/i} speeches on this idea; it's pretty fascinating stuff. "
    s abbbaca "要是这方面你不清楚的话，可以去读读{i}马丁·尼莫拉{/i}的一些名言；他的文笔真的非常出色。"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2011
translate chinese s_answer_politics_4ebbfabb:

    # s bbbbaca "But when people start caring about others affected by war, by famine, by injustice, {w=0.5}{nw}"
    s bbbbaca "只有人们开始关注他人的困境，关注那些战争、饥荒与不公，{w=0.5}{nw}"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2012
translate chinese s_answer_politics_c062b419:

    # extend abbccaa "that's when things can really be changed for the better."
