# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2148
translate chinese s_answer_reality_b9a2773b:

    # s abhfaoa "Oh I've already seen lots of things about it on the internet!"
    s abhfaoa "哦哦，这方面我在网上已经看得很多了！"

# game/dialogs/script-topics.rpy:2149
translate chinese s_answer_reality_ff8bf969:

    # s abhfcoa "It looks like such a big and fancy place, full of beautiful sights, culture, and kind people."
    s abhfcoa "感觉像是华丽缤纷的大世界：美不胜收的风景、丰富的文化，还有那些善良的人们。"

